      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right margin",
          "value": "<p>You have the tact and the skill that inevitably resolve such crises, this one in particular. May God relieve your heart and undo your sorrows. This prayer we have in common, for I am one with you in joy and trouble. . . .</p>\n<p>As for the account, it is in the shop and I am at home,</p>",
